  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ub88ec2a5\" id=\"ub88ec2a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f5bc1f7\" id=\"u3f5bc1f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">一个完整的linux系统，通常包含了Uboot、kernel、设备树以及根文件系统。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"sl7DM\" id=\"sl7DM\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9747a253\" id=\"u9747a253\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">UBoot</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u45e994a6\" id=\"u45e994a6\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a6c90f3\" id=\"u2a6c90f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">Uboot的全称 Universal Boot Loader,是一个主要用于嵌入式系统的引导加载程序，是一套在GNU通用公共许可证之下发布的自由软件。遵循GPL条款的开源项目</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9f6cabd4\" id=\"u9f6cabd4\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31e29040\" id=\"u31e29040\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">U-Boot的主要作用是用来启动操作系统内核，它分为两个阶段，即boot + loader， boot阶段启动系统，初始化硬件设备，建立内存空间映射图，将系统的软硬件带到一个合适的状态， loader阶段将操作系统内核文件加载至内存，之后跳转到内核所在地址运行。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"qKexr\" id=\"qKexr\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ab15374\" id=\"u9ab15374\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">Linux内核</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ueb3b1bc9\" id=\"ueb3b1bc9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7e87a91\" id=\"ue7e87a91\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">Linux是一种开源电脑操作系统内核。它是一个用C语言写成，符合POSIX标准的类Unix操作系统。 Linux内核是一个用来和硬件打交道并为用户程序提供一个有限服务集的低级支撑软件。一个计算机系统是一个硬件和软件的共生体，它们互相依赖，不可分割。计算机的硬件，含有外围设备、处理器、内存、硬盘和其他的电子设备组成计算机的发动机。但是没有软件来操作和控制它，自身是不能工作的。完成这个控制工作的软件就称为操作系统，在Linux的术语中被称为“内核”，也可以称为“核心”。Linux内核的主要模块（或组件）分以下几个部分：进程管理子系统、内存管理子系统、文件子系统、网络子系统、设备子系统等。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub42ac753\" id=\"ub42ac753\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fjpeg%2F27903758%2F1689079990360-55488c96-75d9-44cf-9973-70df7499c98c.jpeg%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ude9265d8-5905-4400-98fa-90b96f243bb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4db1395d-0a13-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1052.888888888889%2C%22height%22%3A985%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22imagec004.jpeg%22%2C%22size%22%3A219425%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2369%2C%22originHeight%22%3A2216%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%AD%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A959%2C%22y%22%3A565%2C%22width%22%3A393%2C%22height%22%3A63%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A878%2C%22width%22%3A390%2C%22height%22%3A63%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E5%AD%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A472%2C%22y%22%3A1623%2C%22width%22%3A280%2C%22height%22%3A63%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E5%AD%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1434%2C%22y%22%3A1621%2C%22width%22%3A279%2C%22height%22%3A68%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%AD%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1772%2C%22y%22%3A877%2C%22width%22%3A277%2C%22height%22%3A64%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%AD%90%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1109%2C%22y%22%3A877%2C%22width%22%3A375%2C%22height%22%3A57%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A1045%2C%22y%22%3A1005%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A1008%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A1379%2C%22y%22%3A1010%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BB%9C%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A796%2C%22y%22%3A1759%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1887%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A60%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1091%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A56%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8A%22%2C%22x%22%3A278%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A59%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A1352%2C%22y%22%3A1755%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A5%97%E6%8E%A5%E5%AD%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A314%2C%22y%22%3A1755%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1826%2C%22y%22%3A1323%2C%22width%22%3A180%2C%22height%22%3A51%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A1373%2C%22y%22%3A1164%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A318%2C%22y%22%3A1006%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A1862%2C%22y%22%3A1153%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B5%E8%A1%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1030%2C%22y%22%3A1167%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A50%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1250%2C%22y%22%3A1332%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9D%97%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A1646%2C%22y%22%3A1755%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22111111%22%2C%22x%22%3A1852%2C%22y%22%3A1219%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SLAB%22%2C%22x%22%3A1451%2C%22y%22%3A1336%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%A0%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A562%2C%22y%22%3A1756%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A313%2C%22y%22%3A1167%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1085%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A61%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SWAP%22%2C%22x%22%3A1031%2C%22y%22%3A1345%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A640%2C%22y%22%3A1161%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VFS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1858%2C%22y%22%3A999%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A50%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f2ee%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u438761eb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"IZLqT\" id=\"IZLqT\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2269e80b\" id=\"u2269e80b\">设备树</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"udfc812de\" id=\"udfc812de\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7291b33\" id=\"ub7291b33\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">设备树用于描述一个硬件平台的硬件资源。这个“设备树”可以被bootloader(uboot)传递到内核， 内核可以从设备树中获取硬件信息。 相当于使用定制的设备树就可以操作不一样的硬件资源， 比如i2c，spi,mipi，mini-pcie，i2s等接口，都是通过设备树去配置使能才能去正常操作它们。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7b479713\" id=\"u7b479713\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689080080880-281a751d-d430-438b-a0a7-835aaa7e1d6e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud43e8dd5-bc5e-49ee-a73a-49845db85c7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4db1395d-0a13-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A309.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A256%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22device_tree_01.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A113319%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A696%2C%22originHeight%22%3A576%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPI%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A349%2C%22y%22%3A236%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A98%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%A0%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A143%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B9%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A221%2C%22y%22%3A484%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPI1%22%2C%22x%22%3A397%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DDR%22%2C%22x%22%3A108%2C%22y%22%3A377%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPI2%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A367%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf9f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2ef3c188%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua5e92a8d\" id=\"ua5e92a8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ce8a31c\" id=\"u6ce8a31c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">设备树以“树状”结构描述硬件资源。例如本地总线为树的“主干”在设备树里面称为“根节点”， 挂载到本地总线的spi总线为树的“枝干”在设备树里称为“根节点的子节点”， spi总线下的spi设备不止一个，这些“枝干”又可以再分。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufb900939\" id=\"ufb900939\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucd97308a\" id=\"ucd97308a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">设备树的使用</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf931e624\" id=\"uf931e624\"><span data-lake-id=\"u817a3057\" id=\"u817a3057\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">在LubanCat-RK系列的板子中，每块板子都有很多的主设备树，位于</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud6401b63\" id=\"ud6401b63\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8aba1aca\" id=\"u8aba1aca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">/boot/dtb</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud38d2700\" id=\"ud38d2700\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u542282c6\" id=\"u542282c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">里</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3ab6b40f\" id=\"u3ab6b40f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1231e731\" id=\"u1231e731\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">由于我们的通用镜像需要支持很多不同的板子，因此，我们通过开机读取设备id改变设备树，从而适配不同的板子</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u68eed576\" id=\"u68eed576\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c30db90\" id=\"u8c30db90\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">LubanCat-RK系列的板子的设备树由一个文件来指定,它是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7bc0c638\" id=\"u7bc0c638\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">/boot/rk-kernel.dtb</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8c4427a6\" id=\"u8c4427a6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> ，如下图：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u100a0edb\" id=\"u100a0edb\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689080185256-f2b230da-fdef-442f-8f47-f290c87c029a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub1c2d2a9-3ba1-4ace-9fec-75af30b5653%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4db1395d-0a13-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A347.1111111111111%2C%22height%22%3A111%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22device_tree_02.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A31505%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A78